flowchart TD
A[Client Request] --> B[NestJS API]
B --> C{Authentication Required?}
C -- Yes --> D[Validate JWT and Role]
D --> E{Authorized?}
E -- No --> X[401 or 403]
E -- Yes --> F[Validate DTO and Business Rules]
C -- No --> F
F --> G{Valid?}
G -- No --> Y[400 Validation Error]
G -- Yes --> H[Service Layer]
H --> I[(PostgreSQL via Prisma)]
I --> J[Structured Response]
J --> K[Client UI Update]